    "text": "We know <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><msub><mi>Av</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></msub></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#961;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#961;</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#961;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><msub><mi>Av</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></math><br />Drift velocity can be written as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></msub></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#964;</mi></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#961;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"